    "voice_type": "none",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "早上七点，苏念打开咖啡店的门。"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 2,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian",
      "Lin Ke",
      "grandmother"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Su Nian",
    "action_visual": "the handwriting on the sticky note fades by one stroke",
    "spoken_dialogue": "营业中",
    "dialogue_speaker": "Su Nian",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "onscreen",
    "focus_object": "sticky note",
    "emotion": "Mystery",
    "source_text": "阳光从巷子里涌进来，照在吧台上，照在墙上的便签上。便签上的字比昨天又淡了一点——但还在。\n她把\"营业中\"的牌子挂好，开始准备。"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 3,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian",
      "Lin Ke",
      "grandmother"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Su Nian",
    "action_visual": "Su Nian grinds coffee beans, the grinder humming",
    "spoken_dialogue": "",
    "dialogue_speaker": "",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "none",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "磨豆机转了三圈。豆子碎了，空气里弥漫着焦糖和坚果的味道。九十二度的水，研磨度二点五，萃取时间二十五秒。这些数字刻在她手指上，比她的名字还清楚。\n第一杯咖啡冲好了"
  },
