    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "none",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "门口的风铃响了。"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 9,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Gu Shen",
      "Chen Rui",
      "Su Yuan"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Gu Shen",
    "action_visual": "Gu Shen walks through the door",
    "spoken_dialogue": "美式。",
    "dialogue_speaker": "Gu Shen",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "onscreen",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "顾深走进来。今天他穿了一件浅灰色的衬衫，没打领带。他的右手拎着一个纸袋——里面是灯泡，暖光的那种。\n\"美式。\"他坐到吧台前的老位置上。"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 10,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian",
      "Gu Shen",
      "Lin Ke",
      "Chen Rui",
      "Su Yuan",
      "grandmother"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Su Nian",
    "action_visual": "Su Nian grinds coffee beans, the grinder humming",
    "spoken_dialogue": "",
    "dialogue_speaker": "",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "none",
    "focus_object": "cup rim",
    "emotion": "Mystery",
    "source_text": "苏念开始做。手在动，磨豆、压粉、萃取。咖啡液流出来，深棕色的，带着一层薄薄的油脂。\n她把咖啡端过去。\n顾深接过杯子，喝了一口。他的嘴唇碰到杯沿，留下一个模糊的印"
  },
